      {
        "id": 97907,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-02T14:59:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Many thanks arenson9 for coordinating this. He did a lot to make it happen and gave a bunch of us a great opportunity to help the game and enjoy a new and interesting con!</p>\n<p>And also thanks to GTG for donating the promo cards and - of course - making a fun game that basically sells itself.&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=9\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\"> &nbsp;The promo cards were really appreciated; we had a lot of folks who already had the game but didn't have the promo cards, but we also had a lot of folks we introduced to the game who fell in love in the first few minutes, and the promo cards gave them something to remind them when they left that they could look forward to enjoying.</p>",
        "post_number": 27,
        "post_type": 1,
