      {
        "id": 97908,
        "name": "bessyrocks12",
        "username": "bessyrocks12",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bessyrocks12/{size}/2447_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-02T17:21:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It was great to see several people return from day one to day two. We didn't have much success either night, losing to Plague Rat and Dawn the first and a stalemate with Skinwalker Gloomweaver. (Matriarch was the sole victory at my table, at which there was much rejoicing). I wish I had more time to enjoy the Con, but it seemed to have a better variety than ComicCon earlier this year. Thanks to arenson9 and Rabit for spearheading getting involved in this.&nbsp;</p>",
